- When expressing conditional constraints for multiple cases, combine conditions with `&&` inside a single fact or predicate block to avoid parsing errors.  
- Abstract modeling of concurrency events as sets with cardinality constraints enables clean temporal reasoning about simultaneous triggers without explicit time intervals.

